All code in this repository was written for it, from the public IEEE 1800
(SystemVerilog) and IEEE 1800.2 (UVM) standards. No third-party code is stored here.

scripts/setup.sh downloads, at setup time and into the git-ignored third_party/ folder:
  - the Accellera UVM reference library (IEEE 1800.2) from https://www.accellera.org
  - optionally, Verilator from https://github.com/verilator/verilator
Each of those keeps its own license; see the license files inside the downloads.
